Z||000015||contra||08-18-2000||01:50 AM||||The paint was done by the painter for a body shop near my house. the paintshop itself though is around 20mins from toronto in ajax. they did an excellent job, the whole paintjob cost me around $850canadian. I agree that maybe the vents should have been kept black, but it's not like i can't paint them black whenever i want :) i thought i'd just see how they looked red considering it didn't cost me any more to do them.<BR>Darklord, i live in scarborough, but i'm usually in etobicoke alot visiting my girlfriend, and i also work in etobicoke. so you'll probably be seeing alot of my car. it's kinda hard to miss :)<BR>||||reg||1
